%*(19秒)+297%伤害","ps":"加攻击26.6%，专二加BUFF持续1900","ss":"攻击光环17.3%"},"employment":"新时代通用后排攻击拐+复制，通常用于提升输出频率，主教战可提升奶灯频率，总力大决出场率极高","advice":"FES池必抽人权角色，部分轴没有专二的增益延长可能会掉buff，建议专二起步"},"officialImages":["https://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_908/h_1210/829/72324/2025/5/4/36744.png"],"expressions":["https://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_550/h_550/829/72324/2025/5/17/195601.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_550/h_550/829/72324/2025/5/17/680525.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_550/h_550/829/72324/2025/5/17/487982.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_550/h_550/829/72324/2025/5/17/560869.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_550/h_550/829/72324/2025/5/17/887124.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_550/h_550/829/72324/2025/5/17/725627.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_550/h_550/829/72324/2025/5/17/823237.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_550/h_550/829/72324/2025/5/17/289453.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_550/h_550/829/72324/2025/5/17/303169.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_550/h_550/829/72324/2025/5/17/116626.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_550/h_550/829/72324/2025/5/17/926481.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_550/h_550/829/72324/2025/5/17/504839.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_550/h_550/829/72324/2025/5/17/407466.png"]}